#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_change_appearance.rst:5
msgid "Change appearance conductor"
msgstr "更改外观导线"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_change_appearance.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows changing the `conductors appearance`_, the line style "
"and color can be defined for each `conductor`_."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech允许改变 `导体外观 <conductors appearance_>`_，每 `导体 <conductor_>`_ "
"的线条样式和颜色可以定义。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_change_appearance.rst:10
msgid "To change the conductor appearance:"
msgstr "要改变导线外观："

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_change_appearance.rst:12
msgid "`Select the conductor`_ which should be edited."
msgstr "`选择应当编辑的导体 <Select the conductor_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_change_appearance.rst:13
msgid "`Display conductor properties`_ PopUp window."
msgstr "`播放导体属性 <Display conductor properties_>`_ 弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_change_appearance.rst:14
msgid "Go to **Appearance** tab."
msgstr "转到 **Appearance** 标签 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_change_appearance.rst:19
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech conductor appearance PopUP window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech导体外观 PopUP 窗口"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_change_appearance.rst:22
msgid ""
"Choose the desired parameters for main color and secondary color if "
"necessary."
msgstr "必要时选择主色和次色的理想参数。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_change_appearance.rst:23
msgid ""
"Click the check button **Apply properties to all conductor of this "
"potential** if the changes should be applied for all `conductor`_ with "
"common initial or end `terminal`_."
msgstr ""
"单击检查按钮 **将属性应用到此潜力的所有导师** 如果修改应适用于所有人 `导体 <conductor_>`_ 带有共同初始或结束 `端子 "
"<terminal_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_change_appearance.rst:24
msgid ""
"Click or unclick the option **Apply properties to all conductors of this "
"potential**."
msgstr "单击或取消单击此选项 **, 将属性应用到此潜能的所有导师** 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_change_appearance.rst:25
msgid "Press **OK** button to save and apply the property changes."
msgstr "按 **OK** 按钮保存并应用属性更改 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_change_appearance.rst:29
msgid ""
"For more information about conductor appearance, refer to `conductor "
"appearance`_ section."
msgstr "关于导体外观的更多信息，参见 `导体外观 <conductor appearance_>`_ 节。"
